    "title": "Huntsville City Schools Faces Continued Wave of Teacher and Staff Resignations - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Bouldin ,\n1 days ago HUNTSVILLE, Ala. — The Huntsville City Schools (HCS) system continues to face high staff turnover, with 350 resignations reported in 2024, according to system data cited by AL.com. That figure is only 10 fewer than in 2022, when the district recorded its highest number of resignations in recent years. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
